From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0310-fog-01-runtime-per-tap-gathers.patch

Source: 0310-fog-01-runtime-per-tap-gathers.patch
Core patch, for tools/eglantine-patches as 0190.

Port of the gather part of Orchid 639479af5 (MythosOfs). The commit's routed
global atomics are not taken here. Run61 logs "Not all arguments in PTP are
immediate, ignoring" 8 times at boot, with no shader named, so that is 8 gathers
in at most 8 shaders. Those gathers lose their offsets and read the plain 2x2
footprint. ConstOffsets takes constants only, so gather once per tap with that
tap's offset and keep component w, as textureGatherOffsets does.

Switch: EDEN_NX2_RUNTIME_PTP=1. Default off, the old behaviour. Shaders are
translated at every boot, so no fresh cache is needed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
